majoris-media (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Observe typed source colorimetry, HDR10/HLG/HDR10+ scene metadata and
    available Dolby Vision profile information without inventing display HDR.
  * Configure a conservative SDR BT.709/BT.1886 OpenGL rendering target.
  * Permit bounded host-provided display ICC profiles through the libmpv API.
